[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":42,"col":9},"end":{"line":42,"col":10}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: an argument of this function call may have an effect,\nand `browser-inline` evaluates a call written in place in each binding function\nthat reads it (§8.4); one that several functions read, or none, is a memo node,\nwhich slice S3 brings (`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.7; §5, class 4). The\nprogram is valid: it builds with `--platform=browser-tea`."}]
